# Build artifacts
#
# Cargo writes the compiled output and the incremental caches here. The path is
# anchored to the repository root so that a directory of the same name inside a
# crate is not ignored by accident.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# The lock file is deliberately not ignored. QuantRule ships a shell
# application, so Cargo.lock pins the exact dependencies of the build that is
# published, and it is committed like any other source file.

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

/data/
